  "healthOffInHealthApp": "In the Health app, tap your profile picture, then Apps, and let Heart read.",
  "@healthOffInHealthApp": {
    "description": "iOS only. Body of the dialog behind the info button on the greyed-out Health header, shown once the user has been asked and nothing is being read. The dialog's button opens the Health app; this is what to do on arrival, since Apple gives no way to link straight to Heart's row. An instruction, not an explanation — do not add why the permission is there rather than in Heart. Match the wording Apple's Health app uses in this locale",
